{"unit_id":"tag:09YS:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>设<MATH_0002>为映射（map），其两端为可构造层（constructible sheaves），其值为集合（sets），定义于<MATH_0003>上。则点（points）的集合（set）<MATH_0004>，在这些点处<MATH_0005>满射（surjective），或分别为<SPACE_0001>单射（injective），或分别<SPACE_0002>同构（isomorphic）于给定的映射（map），其两端为集合（sets），在<MATH_0006>中可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0003>设<MATH_0007>为可构造（constructible）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），定义于<MATH_0008>上。支撑（support），对于<MATH_0009>而言，可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0004>设<MATH_0010>为 Noether 环（Noetherian ring）。设<MATH_0011>为可构造（constructible）层（sheaf），其值为<MATH_0012>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0013>上。支撑（support），对于<MATH_0014>而言，可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether 环"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"