{"unit_id":"tag:09YS:proof","translation":"(1)的证明。设<MATH_0001>为划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0002>，其各项为局部闭（locally closed）的可构造（constructible）子概形（subschemes），使得<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>在各部分上均有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）（对<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>都使用引理<REF_0001>，并选择共同加细（refinement））。再应用引理<REF_0002>于限制（restriction），将映射（map）限制到每个部分。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n(2)和(3)的证明略去。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"subschemes","target_term":"子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"subschemes","target_term":"子概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05BE:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n以下引理稍后会非常有用。它大致是说，范畴（category），其对象为可构造层（constructible sheaves），具有某种弱的“ Noether（Noetherian）”性质。\n\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
